            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Добавь <code>\"sugar\"</code> в конец массива, используя код <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cookies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'flour', 'butter', 'sugar' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
