            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Добавь <code>2</code>, затем <code>500</code> в конец массива.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [\" /><text value=\"-100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions.push(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(transactions);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ -100, 5, 2, 500 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>(</code>, затем <code>2</code>, а затем <code>500</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Раздели значения запятой, чтобы добавить несколько сразу с помощью <code>.push()</code>. Добавь <code>2</code>, затем <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [\" /><text value=\"-100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions.push(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(transactions);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ -100, 5, 2, 500 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>push</code>, затем <code>(</code>, <code>2</code>, <code>500</code>, и наконец <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
